OL,5,Aclimax
OL,6,
OL,7,FWe now know who has won! The Celebrity
OL,8,FTraitors final has just wrapped up with
OL,9,Fa nail-biting finish
OL,11,FTwists and shocks saw 21 contestants
OL,12,Fwhittled down over the series, as the
OL,13,Ffaithful and traitors battled it out -
OL,14,Frelive the final in pictures (contains
OL,15,Fspoilers)
OL,17,FWe've got you covered with post-match
OL,18,Fanalysis in The Celebrity Traitors:
OL,19,FUncloaked, you can watch live above as
OL,20,FEd Gamble talks to the players
